('concrete-foundations','Concrete foundations','Build from a solid beginning.','Plan the concrete foundation for your next building project with the site and construction requirements in mind.','Foundation work needs a clearly defined scope. Share available plans, dimensions, and project requirements so the concrete work can be discussed alongside any required engineering and approvals.',['Building plans','Site conditions','Project coordination'],['concrete-slabs','pole-barn-slabs']),
('concrete-slabs','Concrete slabs','A practical base for your plans.','Concrete slabs create usable surfaces for a range of residential and property projects.','Tell us what the slab will support and how the space will be used. Dimensions, access, loads, finish, and drainage help shape the project. Thickness and reinforcement depend on the specific application.',['Intended use','Dimensions and access','Surface finish'],['pole-barn-slabs','concrete-foundations']),
